{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_rope_set_1_story_2","groupId":"story_rope_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"鲜花香水","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_2.txt","sourceHash":"79e12cfa2efbf6907b097dcaa749ed4f5c639978c1f10e5760a0b60df0d400c0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太对不起了，刚刚因为在配制花卉需要的土壤，没注意到有客人，一时反应过度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"真的好丢人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没事没事，别在意，也是我不该擅自进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"没有这回事，罗德岛的大家本来就可以随意出入，没有关系的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，暗索小姐也真是，来了的话就直接喊我一声嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我可就差喊破喉咙了，你完全没反应呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，总之没什么危险就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么没什么，别在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......总之，谢谢关心~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，在疗养庭院是不会有危险的哦，毕竟这里是让客人们可以完全安下心来的地方，安全是有保障的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，舱室外面还有那么多层安保系统，不是咱们内部的人完全进不来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"没错~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"说到这个，暗索小姐是什么时候进门的？奇怪，门前应该装了摇铃才对呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"摇铃？哦，你说的是门口那个只要碰到藏在地上的装置，就会响的小铃铛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"对啦，就是那个，我一直把它当客铃在用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"因为有的时候忙起来我会注意不到客人，所以可露希尔小姐就帮我安装了那个摇铃，只要门口的铃响，我这边工作间也会收到提醒哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿~你说的是那个装置的话，我直接跳过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？跳......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，来路不明的装置当然不能随便乱踩！走路不出声，爬墙不留痕，这可是生存必备技能呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"当初可露希尔小姐花了一个小时时间才把装置藏好，还说绝对不会有人发现呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"暗索小姐真厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"好说好说，这事儿上我是专业的~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等等，调香师小姐，脸上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"沾到泥了......哎，这儿，这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，欸，脸上?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"这里吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，算了，我来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，擦掉啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（咦，这个味道的变化是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没有，没什么，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（一点点的话，应该没问题吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，暗索小姐，来找我有什么事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"平常很少在这里看到你呢，啊，莫非是暗索小姐开始对调香感兴趣了？如果是那样的话，我这里随时欢迎哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是这么回事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，那是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是博士，对没错是博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"博士拜托我来取一些香薰，就要，呃，他平常常用的那种，帮助睡眠的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，博士又睡不着了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧？前两天出任务的时候看起来精神就不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"而且还强撑着带队来支援......（小声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你刚刚说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么！你听错啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......是这样吗，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"要的是博士常用的，薰衣草香对吧？我知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果暗索小姐不赶时间的话，可以等我处理完这些培养土再替你取香薰吗？现在手上全是泥，不太方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"暗索小姐可以先在温室里随意转转，只要一点点时间就好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"当然没问题~我就在这里逛逛就好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（搅拌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这花长得还挺可爱的，小小的......咦咦咦怎么突然长高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（搅拌）（搅拌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，吓死人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"居然连一朵花都这么危险，温、温室真是深不可测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（搅拌）（忍笑）（搅拌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这个是......香料？呜哇，好香的味道，嗯，嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈、哈——啾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啾、哈啾、呃，唔呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"暗索小姐，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我很好。哈啾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不要勉强哦，那些花和香料都是我用来调香的材料，比起成品，可能味道不是那么好，会更刺激一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"何止是刺激了一点，哈、哈啾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"我的鼻子感觉都要废掉了......居然每天面对这些，还能让这些味道变得那么好闻，我现在是真的开始敬佩你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说就太夸张了。啊对了，暗索小姐，那边的长桌上有一个绿色的小瓶子，如果鼻子不舒服的话，可以稍微闻一闻，应该会好很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——！感谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，绿色的，绿色的......哈啾！有了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个味道好好闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜欢就好。有感觉好一点了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不打喷嚏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"这玩意好灵啊！好厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，暗索小姐以前是不是觉得，香薰没什么太大用处，只是心理作用，是奢侈的娱乐品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"也、也没有这么想啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不用紧张，我并不介意哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"大家最开始接触调香和香薰的时候，多少都会有些误会，毕竟是完全没有了解的领域，暗索小姐会这么想也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"怎样让大家真正了解调香，愿意去了解调香，这就是我需要去努力的事情啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎么说呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我的确不太了解调香，但是我也知道调香师小姐的工作很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟博士还有那位凯尔希医生都说好，那就错不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，博士和凯尔希医生都......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，我有听到他们说过好几回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"“莱娜的香薰在先导治疗和恢复领域很有优势”......类似这样的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上也有不少干员很爱往这里跑吧？据说还有人会直接睡在温室不想走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"是有一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这个，最近还特地多加了一些床位，但空间还是不太够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"再这么下去的话，可能会需要向凯尔希医生申请，将温室再扩大一些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，这就对啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是很棒嘛，已经有很多人明白调香的好了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我搞不太清楚，但我不了解的东西太多啦，总不能因为自己不懂，就说这东西也没用，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎么突然笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"调香师小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，抱歉，嗯，就是有点高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"暗索小姐不要在意。以及，如果不介意的话，可以直接叫我莱娜就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，啊，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那么我也直接叫小暗索了哟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"可以当然是可以啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，那就这么定了"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（咦咦咦咦，怎么回事啊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（调香师小姐是这么自来熟的人吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，调香师小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，莱、莱娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。什么事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......有没有人说过，你意外地很强势欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"没有哟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"你骗人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，也行吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，这样培养土应该就完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我去洗个手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"已经好了？唔，我好像看不出这土和之前有什么区别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是用来培育花种的土壤，里面的成分配比会比较特殊一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"花种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦。葛罗莉亚的治疗到了一个新阶段，需要用到一些很特殊的花卉，对于土壤的要求出乎意料地高呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，之前几次尝试培育都不是很成功，这次是想试一试新的配比，看看是不是土壤的比例和营养出了问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是营养的问题的话，倒是好办，不过有些植物生长所需要的远远不止是营养，这就让人比较头痛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"希望这一次能够成功。老实说，这次我还是挺有自信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来怪复杂的，我还以为调香这事儿会更加，嗯，更加优雅的感觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"就是那种，浑身香香的，又漂亮又高雅，好像从来没做过活的大小姐才会做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，小暗索这是在夸奖我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这么想也行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢~但是，我可不是什么没做过活的大小姐哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛，从看到你脸上沾着泥巴的时候起我就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不要取笑我啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，博士常用的熏香，我找找......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得是放在这里的，薰衣草，薰衣草......啊，有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"没错没错！就是这样的小瓶子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"来，给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"这个很受欢迎，很多干员都会选择在睡前用一点，会更好入眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哦~按我的经验来看，包装精美还效果非凡，这应该会是高价品吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"并不会很贵啦，这个是内部的非卖品，目前只有罗德岛的大家用得到哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，不如小暗索你也试试吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？试什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是香薰啦，像这样经过稀释的香薰精油，既便于携带，又有一定缓和情绪的作用，随时随地都可以使用，或许会成为新的潮流呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"暗索小姐这样年轻漂亮的女性用起来最合适不过了！我给你推荐这种香型的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"停，停停停停！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿这么多瓶子出来干什么！？等、等下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"莱娜？？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，小暗索，你为什么要后退，还拿出钩索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"只是给你推荐一下而已，不会吃了你啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"噫，我感觉到了危险......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"真的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......我觉得我没想多！！呜哇！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，小暗索果然很适合香水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里合适啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"身上留下气味会很不妙的......在很多方面都，很不妙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果小暗索实在不愿意的话，我当然不会勉强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，真的很合适啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊啊啊我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"我用！我用还不行吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会搞成这样的......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，那，博士的香薰我就先拿走了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊对了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"差点就忘记了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"你还会随身携带种子啊，收好不要再丢咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"居然现在就要还给我了吗？比我想的要快呢，我还以为至少要再过两天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？等下，你在说什么，等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"这个语气，欸，难道莱娜你知道我拿了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，我的鼻子可是很灵的哦，就算只是位置发生了一点点变化，也可以闻得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起，我不是故意的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，那个，坏习惯犯了......呜呜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不用这样，我并没有怪你呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......实际上，我本来是打算再多准备一下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？准备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"准备什么？要报警吗？是准备要报警来抓我吗呜呜呜呜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊，小暗索？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"别激动，你别激动，不会报警的啦，不会有人来抓你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"真的真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜呜莱娜你真是大好人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哭了这么久，一滴眼泪也没挤出来呢，小暗索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"诶嘿。被发现啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的事情就不提了吧！刚刚莱娜你说要准备，是要准备什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"小暗索你拿走的那个，是一枚花种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"花的，种子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，我本来打算替这枚种子准备一些合适的土壤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"这个花种很昂贵吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"并不会呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是很稀有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"也不算少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然常见又平凡，但用心栽培的话，就会开出很好看的花，也很适合调香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，不管是什么样的种子，最终都要回归土壤，然后都能开出好看的花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来打算，等到下次你来归还种子的时候，就劝你亲手将这枚种子种下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"让我亲手......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"没错哦，然后等到长出花儿，我就替你用这朵花做一款香薰吧~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？为我？做香薰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"一定需要一个理由吗？嗯......我想想哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因为，我从之前就一直觉得，小暗索一定会很适合熏香吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哼~哼哼~哼哼哼~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"晨露，薄荷，碎冰沙♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，博士，还在处理战斗报告吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"上次任务多谢啦，我还以为这次真的要小命不保，没想到博士你早有安排呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你就没必要跟着支援小队一起来了吧？也太危险了一点。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我需要确保干员的安全。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，真的危急时刻我会抓着博士你一起跑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，这个给你，你用的香薰是这种没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是，呃......是调香师、不对，是莱娜托我带给你的！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看起来很开心。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你好像有点不一样了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，看得出来？很明显吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"因为有好事~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗索","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"偷偷告诉你，我亲手种的花，很快就要开花啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_181_flower","aliases":["调香师"]},{"speakerId":"char_236_rope","aliases":["暗索"]}]}
